<p>~I"Some things... are not what they seem... Fire may not be fire... Wind may not be wind... Water may not be water... BUT! The ground you step on, is as solid as it will ever be."~nLord of the Elements~.
<p> You! (Eagle Eye) are the last hope for the nimbian people. Along with your ally (Galar), you will have to find a way to put a stop to the dark forces. The spirit of nimbus is with you... Good Luck!

$Button=Review Knowledge,ShowTechnology,55
